<title>SWEDEN: Swedish August unemployment rises to 9.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish August unemployment rises to 9.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Sweden rose to 9.0 percent in August from 8.8 percent in July, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 Aug 96     July 96    Aug 95</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 9.0	   8.8	  8.0</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 396,000     397,000    356,000</p>
<p>Note - A Reuters poll of economists showed the market had expected an unemployment rate of 8.6 percent in August.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
